  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/1"/>May it be Your will,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/2"/>Adonoy, my God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/3"/>and God of my fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/4"/>to save me today and every day
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/5"/>from arrogant men and from arrogance;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/6"/>from an evil man, from the evil inclination,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/20"/>from an evil companion,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/7"/>from an evil neighbor;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/8"/>from an evil mishap
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/9"/>from an evil eye,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/10"/>from a malicious tongue, from slander,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/11"/>from false testimony, from hatred
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/12"/>from scandal, from unnatural death,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/13"/>from harsh disease, and from misfortune,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/14"/>and from the destructive Satan;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/15"/>from a difficult judgment
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/16"/>and a difficult opponent,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/17"/>whether he is a fellow Jew
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/18"/>or not a fellow Jew
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni/19"/>and from the retribution of Gehinnom.</tei:p>
